 the men and the central is mixed under the restriction that all prisoners living there are sterilized. The women in the western sector want to emigrate from the planet of fear for the men and when they do the men in the east rebel, overthrowing the guards and capturing Jinto to try to stop the emigration of the women. At the same time an enemy fleet heads toward the system forcing Lafiel to abandon Jinto.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Military","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Space","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Space Opera","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aliens","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Elf","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Banner of the Stars II","english":"Banner of the Stars II","native":"星界の戦旗 II","romaji":"Seikai no Senki II","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"星界の戦旗II"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"星界的战旗II"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Pennon Of The Stars 2"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}